{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_FFA14635","title":"Zaffer's Date","entry":"Dlg_FFA14635::entry","exit":"Dlg_FFA14635::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_5214D3DF","articyId":"72057611218045026","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zaffer","text":"You made it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4605BC33","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You made it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":199.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16501","byteOffset":14139640,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_53AA5E65","articyId":"72057611218045040","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zaffer","text":"Good, because this is gonna blow your mind. Check it out! Over there is an ORIGINAL piece by Byal Lapin. The ‘Sec doesn’t know it’s here, or they woulda blasted it off. Isn't it magical?","speakerId":"Ntt_4605BC33","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Good, because this is gonna blow your mind. Check it out! Over there is an ORIGINAL piece by Byal Lapin. The ‘Sec doesn’t know it’s here, or they woulda blasted it off. Isn't it magical?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":799.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31810","byteOffset":19914016,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_AE96CE85","articyId":"72057611218045053","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zaffer","text":"Artpunks come and go but what the Lapin does, it’s more than graffiti. It’s color in a world that’s turning grey. It’s everything CorpSec don’t want you to be or say or feel. It’s life.","speakerId":"Ntt_4605BC33","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Artpunks come and go but what the Lapin does, it’s more than graffiti. It’s color in a world that’s turning grey. It’s everything CorpSec don’t want you to be or say or feel. It’s life.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1700.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17660","byteOffset":14570080,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_7F47F277","articyId":"72057611218045068","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zaffer","text":"The Lapin saved me. You know what I was built for?","speakerId":"Ntt_4605BC33","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The Lapin saved me. You know what I was built for?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2275.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47354","byteOffset":32251336,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_A3655F97","articyId":"72057611218045089","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zaffer","text":"Cute. But no. I was built to maintain CorpSec signs. STOP, KEEP OUT, NO ACCESS, NO RUNNING, day after day after day after day. Nothing but “do not”. ‘Til the day I went to fix a unit in Lowtown and I saw it. A Lapin artwork, sprayed right over the NO LOITERING sign.","speakerId":"Ntt_4605BC33","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Cute. But no. I was built to maintain CorpSec signs. STOP, KEEP OUT, NO ACCESS, NO RUNNING, day after day after day after day. Nothing but “do not”. ‘Til the day I went to fix a unit in Lowtown and I saw it. A Lapin artwork, sprayed right over the NO LOITERING sign.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3175.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20600","byteOffset":15677168,"byteLength":580}},{"id":"DFr_BC8F0CA8","articyId":"72057611218045104","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zaffer","text":"I loitered so hard that I woke up. Saw that if I wanted to live, I had to get out.","speakerId":"Ntt_4605BC33","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I loitered so hard that I woke up. Saw that if I wanted to live, I had to get out.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3775.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47157","byteOffset":32175560,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_1CA82742","articyId":"72057611218045118","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zaffer","text":"I ran. Paid a hacker to break my tracking. Filed the ‘sec serial number of myself. I stopped being Zone Affirmation Fixer #4591 and became Zaffer. Been zaffin' ever since.","speakerId":"Ntt_4605BC33","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I ran. Paid a hacker to break my tracking. Filed the ‘sec serial number of myself. I stopped being Zone Affirmation Fixer #4591 and became Zaffer. Been zaffin' ever since.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4350.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24998","byteOffset":17338216,"byteLength":520}},{"id":"DFr_5750705A","articyId":"72057611218045139","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zaffer","text":"I’ve never told anyone. Or brought anyone here. Except you.","speakerId":"Ntt_4605BC33","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I’ve never told anyone. Or brought anyone here. Except you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4975.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28001","byteOffset":18474224,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_B7A4C5AB","articyId":"72057611218045159","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zaffer","text":"Me too. Don’t make me regret it, love.","speakerId":"Ntt_4605BC33","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Me too. Don’t make me regret it, love.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5837.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26460","byteOffset":17891560,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_177DFC82","articyId":"72057821671319633","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Zaffer","text":"The one and only.","speakerId":"Ntt_4605BC33","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The one and only.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1400.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36166","byteOffset":28028608,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_5818122B","articyId":"72057611218045033","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Wouldn't have missed it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Wouldn't have missed it.","TextSheVersion":"Wouldn't have missed it.","TextTheyVersion":"Wouldn't have missed it."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":499.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44589","byteOffset":31198976,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_AB707496","articyId":"72057611218045047","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You mean the graffiti artist?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You mean the graffiti artist?","TextSheVersion":"You mean the graffiti artist?","TextTheyVersion":"You mean the graffiti artist?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1099.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"fi